1. Call vault_summary to get stats: total memories, top tags, most connected memories,
   important memories, and semantic search status.
2. Format the results as a structured report:
   ## Vault Overview
   - Total memories and semantic search status
   ## Top Topics (by tag frequency)
   - List tags with counts
   ## Most Connected Memories
   - List the hub memories with their connection count
   ## Priority Memories (by importance)
   - List memories with importance > 0
